// Counted resources: professional income (R. 844-1), replacement
// income (R. 844-2), housing/CF/ASF forfaits (R. 844-4), excluded
// benefits (R. 844-5), non-salaried income (R. 845-1/2/3).
//
// «Ont le caractère de revenus professionnels ou en tiennent lieu»
// (R. 844-1 I): ten listed items, 9° abrogated (no value, no rule),
// 5° birth leave from 2026-06-27 applicable 2026-07-01 (NOTA);
// 6° daily allowances only within three months of the work stoppage
// (derived from the retained stoppage date). «sont pris en compte
// pour un montant égal à la différence entre» gross and social
// charges (R. 844-1 II, from 2023-12-31; no II before): non-salaried
// 1° income excluded, computed under R. 845-1/2; the formula needs
// a positively classified covered flux (PA-R4-06). Gross arrives net
// of the II exclusions (employer guarantees, chèques-vacances,
// L. 7233-4 financing: retained convention).
// «Ont le caractère de revenus de remplacement» (R. 844-2): seven
// items; 4° daily allowances only past three months after stoppage
// (mirror of R. 844-1 6°).
// «dans la limite d'un forfait calculé selon les modalités fixées
// aux 1°, 2° et 3° de l'article R. 844-3» (R. 844-4 I): the APL
// forfait value arrives retained net of non-APL persons (R. 844-3
// is owned by CNAF-PPA but outside the FINISH pa 38: same-line
// convergence pending). «à hauteur d'un forfait égal à 41,65 % de
// la base mensuelle» (II, CF majoré L. 522-3); «30 % ... 22,5 % ...
// pour chaque enfant» (III, ASF L. 523-1 per L. 523-3 1°/2° slots):
// BMAF euros arrive retained (bridge request: no public neighbour
// relation).
// «Sont exclues des ressources» (R. 844-5): 39 listed items + 21°bis;
// 2° only in L. 842-7 situations with a child under three months
// (retained marker), 10° only where a non-household third party is
// paid (retained marker), 14° irregularity/insertion purpose through
// the organ judgment channel (DECISION-0194); 18°/21°/29°/30°..39°
// carry their introduction windows (2021-03-25, 2022-03-21,
// 2023-12-31). Each declared category claims its qualifying facts;
// AUTRE_* values have no rule (documented negative space).
// «des bénéfices de l'avant-dernière année ..., ou ceux de la
// dernière année s'ils sont connus, pourvu qu'ils correspondent à
// une année complète d'activité» (R. 845-1/2 al. 1): N-1 known with
// a full activity year overrides N-2 (base_n_1 institutional
// marker; N-2 blocked by its safe negation); full-year markers are
// year-specific; /12. «Lorsque les bénéfices n'ont pas été
// imposés, ou ne correspondent pas à une année complète d'activité»
// (fallback): organ computes a third of M-4..M-2 receipts/turnover
// (preceding quarter under the old wording) minus the CGI abatement
// (64bis al. 2 / 50-0/102ter rates retained; bridge request); R. 845-2
// adds the special independent categories (L. 613-7, L. 642-4-2,
// L. 382-3, L. 382-15). Old/new computation wordings are selected by
// the shared NOTA gates (general 2025-03-01, MSA order date; PA-M4).
// Option on request within the CGI ceilings (12-month and quarterly
// tests), tacit renewal as a standing retained request, joint RSA
// request + CD president agreement as an institutional flag (RSA
// computation stays with RSA).
// «avant déduction des frais professionnels» (R. 845-3, CGI art. 62):
// retained pre-deduction amounts counted as such.

