    CSS_R845_3_ED2026_04_01,
    CSS_R845_3_ED2026_06_27)
rule RevenusArt62(d: Demandeur, mois: Date, m: Money) strict {
    effective [@2021-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "CGI art. 62: retenus avant déduction des frais (R. 845-3)";
    label en unofficial "CGI art. 62: counted before expense deduction (R. 845-3)";
    when revenus_art62_avant_deduction(d, mois, m);
    then revenus_art62_retenus(d, mois, m);
}

// --- Reading D-82/D-84: twelfths and thirds of non-salaried income (R. 845-1/2) rounded to the centime ---
//
// R. 845-1 and R. 845-2 take a twelfth of the profits of year N-2 or N-1 and a third
// of the receipts of the preceding quarter (before 2025-03-01) or of M-4..M-2 (from it),
// the third reduced by the CGI abatement; the text states NO rounding. The base rules
// divide exactly: a quotient that does not terminate makes the document NON_EXECUTABLE
// (INEXACT_DIVISION, SPEC 50/18: rounding only by an explicit policy). The rounding is
// not a text of the law but a READING (SPEC 152, owner decisions D-82 / D-84,
// 08.10.2026), whose basis is the practice of the funds (CNAF): the twelfth and the
// third, intermediate values, are rounded to the centime, HALF_UP. Outside any group:
// unselected it executes nothing and changes no answer; selected
// (context { interpretation fr.css.prime_activite::RessourcesFractionsArrondiesCentime; })
// it replaces the exact division in the 18 rules below (4 twelfths: N-2 and N-1 of both
// categories; 14 thirds: untaxed profits, incomplete year, special independent worker
// and the quarterly option, old and new wording), and the marker silences the
// exact-division rules (not_known), so revenu_agri / revenu_bic carry ONE value under
// either choice. It rounds ALWAYS when selected, also where the exact quotient is longer
// than two places (as the funds do). Only the division is rounded: the product with the
// complement of the abatement rate (1 - t) stays exact, and the ceiling comparisons
// (rt <= p / 4, a terminating quotient) are not divisions of this reading.

pub relation lecture_ressources_fractions_arrondies() kind institutional {
    label fr official "lecture retenue : les douzièmes et tiers de revenus non salariés (R. 845-1/2) sont arrondis au centime (D-82, D-84 ; marqueur de la lecture RessourcesFractionsArrondiesCentime)";
    label en unofficial "selected reading: the twelfths and thirds of non-salaried income (R. 845-1/2) are rounded to the centime (D-82, D-84; marker of the reading RessourcesFractionsArrondiesCentime)";
}

